  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 and resnet50 achieve high accuracy (config_033: 0.713). This experiment tests whether replacing resnet50 with the more advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder (while keeping scvi_n200 RNA encoder, transformer aggregation, and concat fusion) improves performance. This isolates the effect of the image encoder, a critical design choice, and explores whether stronger visual representations can further enhance performance in a singleprofile setting."
